            "title": "Public cloud",
            "text": "A public cloud is offered over the internet, shared among many organizations and managed by a third-party provider."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Businesses of all sizes use Amazon Web Services to get virtual servers and storage without managing physical hardware."
